      "generated_answer": "We split the sum into two parts:  \n$\\sum_{n=1}^\\infty \\frac{1}{e^n} = \\frac{1/e}{1 - 1/e} = \\frac{1}{e - 1}$, a geometric series.  \n$\\sum_{n=1}^\\infty \\frac{1}{n(n+1)} = \\sum_{n=1}^\\infty \\left(\\frac{1}{n} - \\frac{1}{n+1}\\right) = 1$, a telescoping series.  \nSo total sum is $\\frac{1}{e - 1} + 1 \\approx \\frac{1}{1.718} + 1 \\approx 0.582 + 1 = 1.582$.  \nThis is closest to **1.581**.\n\n\\boxed{D}",
