    "prompt": "Please read the following multiple-choice questions and provide the most likely correct answer based on the options given.\n\nContext: None\n\nQuestion: a bag contains 7 green and 8 white balls . if two balls are drawn simultaneously , the probability that both are of the same colour is - .\n\nOptions: \nA. 7 / 18\nB. 7 / 19\nC. 7 / 11\nD. 7 / 12\nE. 7 / 15\n\n\nProvide the correct letter choice in \\boxed{X}, where X is the correct letter choice. Keep the explanation or feedback within 3 sentences.",
    "prediction": "qwen/qwen3-235b-a22b-2507",
    "generated_result": {
      "generated_answer": "The total number of ways to draw 2 balls from 15 is $\\binom{15}{2} = 105$. The number of ways to draw 2 green balls is $\\binom{7}{2} = 21$, and for 2 white balls it's $\\binom{8}{2} = 28$. So, the probability of drawing two of the same color is $\\frac{21 + 28}{105} = \\frac{49}{105} = \\frac{7}{15}$.\n\n\\boxed{E}",
