      "generated_answer": "Let the total score of the team be $ x $. If the best marksman had scored 92 instead of 85, the average would have been 84. So, $ x - 85 + 92 = 8 \\times 84 = 672 $. Thus, $ x + 7 = 672 $, so $ x = 665 $.\n\nThe team scored 665 points.\n\n\\boxed{A}",
