      "generated_answer": "The probability of getting heads on the first 3 flips is $(1/2)^3$, and the probability of getting tails on the last 2 flips is $(1/2)^2$. Since the flips are independent, multiply the probabilities: $(1/2)^3 \\times (1/2)^2 = (1/2)^5 = 1/32$. This matches the specific sequence HHHTT.\n\n\\boxed{E}",
