      "generated_answer": "The range of weights that satisfy all three opinions is from greater than 63 kg to less than or equal to 66 kg (since Arun says >63 and <72, brother says >60 and <70, mother says ≤66). So the possible integer weights are 64, 65, and 66 kg. The average of these is (64 + 65 + 66)/3 = 65 kg, but since 65 is not an option, we check: actually, considering continuous values, the average of 63 < weight ≤ 66 is (63 + 66)/2 = 64.5 kg.\n\n$\\boxed{B}$",
