      "generated_answer": "The sequence $ y[n] $ represents the sum of squares of integers from 0 to $ n $, so $ y[n] = y[n-1] + n^2 $ for $ n \\geq 1 $, with $ y[0] = 0 $. This recurrence is equivalent to $ y[n-1] = y[n] - n^2 $, which matches option F. Option F correctly expresses the reverse recurrence relation.\n\n\\boxed{F}",
