    "prompt": "Please read the following multiple-choice questions and provide the most likely correct answer based on the options given.\n\nContext: None\n\nQuestion: A three input information channel with all three input symbols equally probable, is defined by the channel matrix, \\vert0.50.30.2\\vert \\vert0.20.30.5\\vert \\vert0.30.30.4\\vert Assuming that a maximum-likelihood decision rule is used, determine the error probability, P_E, of the channel.\n\nOptions: \nA. (13) / (30)\nB. (19) / (30)\nC. (15) / (30)\nD. (18) / (30)\nE. (14) / (30)\nF. (17) / (30)\nG. (21) / (30)\nH. (12) / (30)\nI. (16) / (30)\nJ. (20) / (30)\n\n\nProvide the correct letter choice in \\boxed{X}, where X is the correct letter choice. Keep the explanation or feedback within 3 sentences.",
