    "generated_result": {
      "generated_answer": "The given expression for $ f(t) $ is a convolution: $ f(t) = (h * \\phi)(t) $. In the frequency domain, convolution becomes multiplication, so the Fourier transform of $ f(t) $ is $ F(\\omega) = H(\\omega) \\Phi(\\omega) $. The power spectral density (PSD) of $ f(t) $ is then $ G_f(\\omega) = |F(\\omega)|^2 = |H(\\omega)|^2 |\\Phi(\\omega)|^2 = |H(\\omega)|^2 G_\\phi(\\omega) $.\n\nThus, the correct answer is:\n\n\\boxed{A}",
