    "prompt": "Please read the following multiple-choice questions and provide the most likely correct answer based on the options given.\n\nContext: None\n\nQuestion: Determine the mean-square quantization error during the quantization of a signal. Assume that the error (equally likely) lies in the range - S/2 to + S/2, where S is the step size.\n\nOptions: \nA. (S^2 / 3)\nB. (S^2 / 12)\nC. (S^2 / 24)\nD. (S^2 / 8)\nE. (S^2 / 18)\nF. (S^2 / 10)\nG. (S^2 / 6)\nH. (S^2 / 30)\nI. (S^2 / 4)\nJ. (S^2 / 16)\n\n\nProvide the correct letter choice in \\boxed{X}, where X is the correct letter choice. Keep the explanation or feedback within 3 sentences.",
