      "generated_answer": "The correct delta response \\( h[n] \\) is derived by solving the difference equation using the **reciprocal polynomial method**. The characteristic equation of the given system is \\( r^2 - \\frac{5}{6}r + \\frac{1}{6} = 0 \\), yielding roots \\( r_1 = \\frac{1}{3} \\) and \\( r_2 = \\frac{1}{2} \\).\n\nThe general solution for the impulse response is:\n\\[\nh[n] = A \\left(\\frac{1}{3}\\right)^n u[n] + B \\left(\\frac{1}{2}\\right)^n u[n]\n\\]\nUsing initial conditions (e.g., \\( h[-1] = 0 \\) and the impulse response at \\( n = 0 \\)), we find \\( A = 3 \\) and \\( B = -2 \\), leading to:\n\\[\nh[n] = 3 \\left(\\frac{1}{3}\\right)^n u[n] - 2 \\left(\\frac{1}{2}\\right)^n u[n]\n\\]\n\nThe correct choice is \\(\\boxed{E}\\).",
