    "global index": "MMLUPro_engineering_10266",
    "prompt": "Please read the following multiple-choice questions and provide the most likely correct answer based on the options given.\n\nContext: None\n\nQuestion: Given the transfer function of a two port network H( \\omega ) = \\vertH(\\omega_0)\\vert exp(-j\\textphi). \\omega Derive an expression for output as a function of time, for the single frequency input v_i =cos\\omega_0t. \\omega\n\nOptions: \nA. |H(ω_0)|cos(2ω_0t - φ)\nB. \u000bertH(\\omega_0)\u000bertcos(\\omega_0t)\nC. |H(ω_0)|exp(-jω_0t)\nD. \u000bertH(\\omega_0)\u000bertcos(\\omega_0t - \textphi)\nE. \u000bertH(\\omega_0)\u000bertcos(\\omega_0t + \textphi)\nF. |H(ω_0)|exp(jω_0t)\nG. |H(ω_0)|sin(2ω_0t + φ)\nH. |H(ω_0)|sin(ω_0t - φ)\nI. |H(ω_0)|sin(ω_0t + φ)\nJ. \u000bertH(\\omega_0)\u000bertsin(\\omega_0t - \textphi)\n\n\nProvide the correct letter choice in \\boxed{X}, where X is the correct letter choice. Keep the explanation or feedback within 3 sentences.",
