      "generated_answer": "Upon realizing that *The Orchid Thief* lacks a usable narrative and cannot be turned into a film, Charlie is left with a serious case of writer's block. This creative paralysis deepens his depression and sense of inadequacy. His struggle is compounded by the pressure of missing his deadline with Columbia Pictures.\n\n\\boxed{{writer's block}}",
