      "generated_answer": "The text does not mention Jeremy cutting his fingers while fishing. Instead, it states that he was pricked by the spines of the stickleback fish and then sucked his sore fingers. Therefore, his injury was caused by the spiny stickleback, not a cut from fishing equipment.\n\n\\boxed{\\text{Jeremy's fingers were pricked by the spines of the stickleback, not cut.}}",
