      "generated_answer": "Sophy accuses Darrow of jealousy when he tries to persuade her not to marry Owen. She believes his objections stem from personal feelings rather than concern for Owen’s well-being. This accusation highlights the underlying tension of their past romantic involvement.\n\n\\boxed{\\text{Sophy accuses Darrow of jealousy.}}",
